{
  "__comment": [
    "storage2 (UniFi UNAS Pro) dashboard (BOX-334).",
    "Every panel selects job=\"storage2\"; the datasource is the ds_prometheus",
    "templating variable (type=prometheus), never a hardcoded UID, so the",
    "dashboard binds to whichever Prometheus datasource it finds — the same",
    "shape Node Exporter Full (grafana.com 1860) uses.",
    "README: capacity, SMART and pool/RAID state are NOT exposed by this device",
    "over SNMP (BOX-314 walked its agent; hrStorageTable and dskTable answer",
    "No Such Object, and no Ubiquiti enterprise MIB is served). Those alerts",
    "stay with UniFi's own notifications. The last row says this on the",
    "dashboard itself so the absence is not read as an omission."
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Reachability",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "UP" } }, "type": "value" }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "min(up{job=\"storage2\"})",
          "legendFormat": "SNMP poll",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "storage2 SNMP reachable",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 0.001 }] },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "max(snmp_scrape_walk_duration_seconds{job=\"storage2\"})",
          "legendFormat": "walk",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "SNMP walk duration",
      "description": "How long a full walk of storage2's subtrees takes. Zero/missing while up=1 is the 'reachable but returning nothing' case that Storage2PollDead alerts on.",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "snmp_cpu_user_percent{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "user",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "snmp_cpu_system_percent{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "system",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "snmp_cpu_idle_percent{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "idle",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "CPU",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 101,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Fans and temperatures",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "rothz"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "snmp_lm_fan_rpm{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{fan}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Fan speed",
      "description": "A fan that reads 0 and has been above 0 in the last 7 days raises Storage2FanStopped. A fan that has always read 0 is an unpopulated slot and never alerts (BOX-320's self-calibrating rule).",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" },
          "unit": "celsius",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 60 }, { "color": "red", "value": 70 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "snmp_lm_temp_celsius{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{sensor}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Temperatures",
      "description": "Any sensor above 70 °C for 10 minutes raises Storage2Hot. The 70 °C line is BOX-320's decision, shown here so the reader sees the threshold.",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 102,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Per-drive I/O",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" },
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 20,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "rate(snmp_diskio_read_bytes_total{job=\"storage2\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}} read",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Read throughput",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" },
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "id": 21,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "rate(snmp_diskio_written_bytes_total{job=\"storage2\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}} write",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Write throughput",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "none" } },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "id": 22,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "rate(snmp_diskio_busy_seconds_total{job=\"storage2\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Drive utilisation",
      "description": "Fraction of the last interval each drive spent busy (UCD diskIOBusyTime). Above ~0.8 sustained is a drive that is the bottleneck.",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "id": 103,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Load and memory",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "id": 30,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "snmp_load{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{window}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Load average",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" },
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 31 },
      "id": 31,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "100 * snmp_mem_avail_kilobytes{job=\"storage2\"} / snmp_mem_total_kilobytes{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "available",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}" },
          "expr": "100 * (snmp_mem_total_kilobytes{job=\"storage2\"} - snmp_mem_avail_kilobytes{job=\"storage2\"}) / snmp_mem_total_kilobytes{job=\"storage2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "used",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Memory",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "id": 104,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "## What this device cannot report\n\nBOX-314 walked storage2's SNMP agent (UNAS Pro, UniFi OS 6.0.18). There is **no capacity, SMART, drive-health or pool/RAID data** available over SNMP: `hrStorageTable` (1.3.6.1.2.1.25.2.3) and UCD `dskTable` (1.3.6.1.4.1.2021.9) both answer *No Such Object*, and no Ubiquiti enterprise MIB is served. The SIEM/syslog stream has no storage or drive categories either.\n\nSo **disk filling, drive failure and degraded pools are watched by UniFi's own push/email notifications**, which are the only documented SMART-driven path for this hardware. Their absence from this dashboard is a boundary of the device, not an omission — do not file a bug to \"add\" them.\n\nWhat *is* here, and what the rules use: fans, temperatures, per-drive I/O, load, memory and CPU, over SNMPv3.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "Boundary: capacity, SMART and pool state are NOT exposed",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "preload": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["storage2", "observability", "snmp"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "__comment": "Datasource variable, the shape Node Exporter Full uses: Grafana binds this dashboard to whichever Prometheus datasource the reader picks, so no UID is baked into any panel.",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Data source",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "ds_prometheus",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "",
  "title": "storage2 (UNAS Pro)",
  "uid": "storage2-nas",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
